# The four standing documents were four routes until they became one page with
# four anchors. A privacy notice and a set of terms are cited by URL — in the
# registration receipt, in mail already sent, and by anyone who linked to them —
# so the old addresses keep resolving, permanently, to the section they became.
#
# Cloudflare's static-asset runtime reads this file. A real asset at the same
# path would win over the rule, which is why those four pages are deleted rather
# than left in place.
/privacy        /policies#privacy        301
/terms          /policies#terms          301
/accessibility  /policies#accessibility  301
/contact        /policies#contact        301

# The marketplace is one page with five anchors, the way the policies are. The
# navigation used to promise five routes; anyone who saved one still lands.
/marketplace/all             /marketplace#all             301
/marketplace/makers          /marketplace#makers          301
/marketplace/how-it-works    /marketplace#how-it-works    301
/marketplace/new             /marketplace#new             301
/marketplace/collections     /marketplace#collections     301
